{"seq":6,"slug":"quantum-information","title":"量子信息科学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/quantum-information","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"量子信息科学-简介\">量子信息科学 简介</h1><p>量子信息科学是以量子力学原理为基础，研究信息的量子表示、传输、处理与应用的交叉学科。它融合了物理学、计算机科学、数学和电子工程等多个领域的核心方法，致力于利用量子叠加、纠缠等独特物理资源，实现经典方法无法达到的信息处理能力。</p>\n<p>本课程体系面向物理学、计算机科学或电子工程背景的高年级本科生与研究生，适合对量子技术前沿感兴趣、希望系统掌握量子信息理论与实验方法的学习者。2026年，人大、南开、哈工大等高校新开设量子信息科学本科专业，清华大学姚期智院士主导的&quot;量信班&quot;持续培养顶尖人才，该领域正迎来人才培养的关键窗口期。</p>\n<p>全书分为四章，按照&quot;基础—计算—通信—应用&quot;的逻辑递进展开：</p>\n<p>第1章<strong>量子力学基础</strong>建立量子信息所需的数学和物理框架，包括量子态的Hilbert空间描述、量子纠缠的本质与度量、以及量子测量与退相干理论，为后续章节奠定严格的理论基础。</p>\n<p>第2章<strong>量子计算</strong>系统讲授量子计算模型，从量子门与线路的基本构建出发，深入Shor算法、Grover搜索等核心量子算法，最终讨论量子纠错与容错计算——这是实现大规模量子计算机的关键瓶颈。</p>\n<p>第3章<strong>量子通信与密码</strong>聚焦量子信息在安全通信中的应用，涵盖BB84等量子密钥分发协议、量子网络架构设计，以及面对量子计算威胁的后量子密码学标准化进展。</p>\n<p>第4章<strong>量子应用与前沿</strong>展示量子技术的实际应用场景，包括量子精密测量（原子钟、量子传感）、量子模拟（量子化学与多体物理）、以及超导量子比特等主流硬件平台的最新进展。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：先修线性代数和量子力学初步，然后按章节顺序学习。第1章为必修基础，第2-4章可根据研究兴趣选择重点深入。建议结合动手实践（如IBM Quantum平台编程）加深理解。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quantum-foundations","title":"量子力学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/quantum-information/quantum-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quantum-states-operators","title":"量子态与算符","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/quantum-information/quantum-foundations/quantum-states-operators"},{"seq":2,"slug":"quantum-entanglement","title":"量子纠缠与Bell不等式","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/quantum-information/quantum-foundations/quantum-entanglement"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quantum-measurement","title":"量子测量与退相干","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/quantum-information/quantum-foundations/quantum-measurement"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"quantum-computing","title":"量子计算","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/quantum-information/quantum-computing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quantum-gates-circuits","title":"量子门与量子线路","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/quantum-information/quantum-computing/quantum-gates-circuits"},{"seq":2,"slug":"quantum-algorithms","title":"量子算法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/quantum-information/quantum-computing/quantum-algorithms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quantum-error-correction","title":"量子纠错与容错计算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/quantum-information/quantum-computing/quantum-error-correction"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"quantum-communication","title":"量子通信与密码","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/quantum-information/quantum-communication","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quantum-key-distribution","title":"量子密钥分发","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/quantum-information/quantum-communication/quantum-key-distribution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"quantum-network","title":"量子网络与量子中继","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/quantum-information/quantum-communication/quantum-network"},{"seq":3,"slug":"post-quantum-cryptography","title":"后量子密码学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/quantum-information/quantum-communication/post-quantum-cryptography"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"quantum-applications","title":"量子应用与前沿","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/quantum-information/quantum-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quantum-sensing","title":"量子精密测量","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/quantum-information/quantum-applications/quantum-sensing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"quantum-simulation","title":"量子模拟","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/quantum-information/quantum-applications/quantum-simulation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quantum-hardware","title":"量子计算硬件平台","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/quantum-information/quantum-applications/quantum-hardware"}]}]}